factory.py: spec takes no --port. usage: prompt <project-slug>/<job-id> <role> [--round N] [--port P] [--out <path>]
roles and flags: spec | approve | build [--round N] [--port P] | review-security, review-ux, review-ui or review-code --round N. Every role also takes --out <path>.
example: prompt sample/042-sample review-code --round 2
